	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-rise MechanicsハロからLEDが同梱されたLIGHTINGユニットセットが発売！",
			"• 外装はノーマルカラー、メタリックグリーンカラーなどの2種が同梱！",
			"• LEDユニットと組み合わせることで成形品越しに目が発光し、「怒り」や「悲しみ」の表情を付けることが可能！",
			"• 手足を引き出すギミックで劇中のイメージに合わせたポーズを再現。",
			"• 全高約80mm。このサイズならではの高密度なメカニカル感。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Figure-rise Mechanics Haro has released a LIGHTING unit set that includes LEDs!",
			"• Two types of exterior are included: normal color and metallic green color!",
			"• When combined with an LED unit, the eyes will emit light through the molded product, making it possible to create expressions of \"anger\" or \"sadness\"!",
			"• Reproduce poses that match the images in the play with a gimmick that pulls out the limbs.",
			"• Overall height approximately 80mm. A high-density mechanical feel unique to this size."
		]
	},
